    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22970" root="شمر" body-key="$">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انشمر</span></b> : see 5, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 2
as syn. with 1 and 5. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also <i>He</i> (a horse)
<i>hastened,</i> or <i>went quickly.</i> (S, O. [Accord. to
Freytag, the verb in this sense in the S is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشتمر</span>;
but this is a mistake.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَى</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَذَ</span> [app. as meaning (assumed tropical:)  <i>It,</i> or <i>he, acted with a
penetrative force </i> or <i>energy</i> (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِمْرٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمَّرِىٌّ</span>)];
and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشتمر</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  And <i>It</i> (the water of a
wall) <i>went away.</i> (A, TA.)

